LoadHome["Load Home Page"]
ListSuggestions["List Refocus Suggestions<br/>fixed number of queries"]
ActiveGate{Learner Active Elsewhere Recently?}
NeglectGate{Course Neglected or Newly Ignored?}
Banner["Refocus Suggestion Banner"]
